      ],
      "text": "The bloom cultist places a hand against the wall or floor in the Cradle of Lamashtu and utters a prayer to the Mother of Monsters. Filaments of fungus slither up into the cultist's flesh, healing 4d6 healing points of damage. The cultist can't Absorb the Bloom for 24 hours."
